flowchart TB
  classDef brand fill:#2F5BEA,stroke:#1E3FA8,color:#ffffff
  classDef warm fill:#FFD9A8,stroke:#D98A2B

  subgraph Intake[Intake stage]
    Start([Start]) --> Rect[Rectangle]:::brand
    Rect --> Round(Rounded)
    Round --> Sub[[Subroutine]]:::warm
  end
  Sub --> Check{Valid?}
  Check -->|yes| Store[(Database)]
  Check -->|no| Fail[Rejected]:::error
  Fail -.-> Log[/Write log/]
  subgraph Output[Output stage]
    Store ==> Hex{{Prepare}}
    Hex --> Circ((Ok))
    Circ --x Para[\Reverse slant\]
    Para --o Trap[/Trapezoid\]
    Trap --> Alt[\Alt trapezoid/]
    Alt --> Flag>Flag shape]
    Flag --> Done(((Done)))
  end
  Log --> Hex
